Third-party data
----------------
The HR dummy dataset is NOT stored in this repository: it is downloaded at load time.

* Employees database by Dmitry Stropalov, https://github.com/h8/employees-database
  (itself derived from the MySQL employees sample database by Fusheng Wang and Carlo Zaniolo),
  licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 Unported License
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/). The release asset `data-v1` of this
  repository is an unmodified mirror of that file and is distributed under the same license.
* Survey, candidate, skill, project and office data are generated by this project
  (backend/src/text2cypher_backend/loader/synthetic.py), partly adapted from neo4j_text2SQL.

